<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Cacao pods are harvested, and their beans are fermented, dried and gently processed before being milled into a fine powder.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each step shapes the deep, chocolatey flavor that makes cacao so loved.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

