<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Ways to enjoy it</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Stir it into warm drinks, blend it into smoothies, or use it in brownies, energy bites and breakfast bowls.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
