	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Simple smoothie inspiration]]></title>
		<link>/simple-smoothie-inspiration/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Build a better blend</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Start with a base of fruit and your favorite milk, then add a spoonful of plant powder for color and flavor.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Moringa pairs beautifully with banana and pineapple, while beetroot loves berries.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Our favorite combinations</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Try moringa, mango and lime; beetroot, strawberry and oat; or cacao, banana and peanut butter.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Easy, delicious smoothie ideas using natural plant powders for a colorful start to your day.]]></excerpt:encoded>
